# Restart app after changes

When you finish making changes to this project (ScreenDimmer):

1. **Kill the running process** – Stop any running ScreenDimmer.exe (e.g. `Stop-Process -Name ScreenDimmer -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue` in PowerShell).
2. **Restart the app** – Start the app again (e.g. run the built exe from `bin\Debug\net8.0-windows\ScreenDimmer.exe` or `dotnet run`).

Do this as the last step before replying, so the user can test the changes immediately.
